.TH 67ZIP 1 "67zip" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
67zip \- archive files into a .67z container
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B 67zip
.I command
[switches...]
.I archive
[files...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
67zip is a command-line archiver with the same commands as p7zip's
.BR 7z .
Archives use the
.B .67z
extension and are compressed with LZMA2 by default.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B a
Add files to an archive.
.TP
.B d
Delete files from an archive.
.TP
.B e
Extract without directory names.
.TP
.B l
List archive contents.
.TP
.B t
Test archive integrity.
.TP
.B u
Update files in an archive.
.TP
.B x
Extract with full paths.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR 7z (1)
